Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n*![Location map of 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.2130929444365, 72.8397930040956](/assets/images/map-icon.png)*\n\n![Location map of 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.2130929444365, 72.8397930040956](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 1.25 Cr**\n\nA spacious 1 bedroom, 2 bathroom Flats in Kandivali West Link Road, Mumbai, is now available for sale at 1.25 Cr.This unfurnished 415 Square Feet home is situated on the 5th floor of a 22-story building, offering ample living space and excellent ventilation.The property includes 1 dedicated parking space, high-speed elevators, visitor's parking, service elevators, and high street retail within\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Veena Sargam, Kandivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639127587747232089-260426120614614.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai *Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.212663, 72.840955*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.212663, 72.840955](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 1.95 Cr**\n\nA comfortable lifestyle awaits in this 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom unfurnished Flats located in Veena Sargam, Kandivali West, Mumbai, offering 635 Square Feet of living space for a price of 1.95 crore.This residence comes with one dedicated parking spot, enhancing its practicality for daily life or as a rental property.The property has been constructed within the last 2 to 4 years, indicating\n\n![Sunil Ransure  profile picture](https://img.squareyards.com/connect/profilepic/919769829879638548605139134787.jpg?aio=w-32;h-32;crop;)\n![ Apartment For Sale in Kandivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639232665833800981-250826145623380.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n*![Lo