Images/IN_639106549872894065-010426034307437.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Team Area in 2 BHK Builder Floor at Highland Harmony, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639106549874989954-010426034307437.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bathroom in 2 BHK Builder Floor at Highland Harmony, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639106549877240464-010426034307437.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bedroom in 2 BHK Builder Floor at Highland Harmony, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639106549879608786-010426034307437.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bathroom in 2 BHK Builder Floor at Highland Harmony, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639106549881833452-010426034308438.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Living Room in 2 BHK Builder Floor at Highland Harmony, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639106549884183410-010426034308438.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Builder Floor for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai *Location map of 2 BHK Builder Floor for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.2127169, 72.838776*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Builder Floor for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.2127169, 72.838776](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 1.49 Cr**\n\nThis semi-furnished 845 square feet builder floor within the Highland Harmony project in Kandivali West, Mumbai, presents a blend of comfort and accessibility.Situated on the ground floor, this 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom residence is ideal for those who value ease of entry and movement, enhanced further by the inclusion of two dedicated parking spaces.Constructed between 2 to 4 years ago, the property\n\nPersonalized home recommendations based on your lifestyle, location, and budget.\n\n![Smarter home match recommendation preview](/assets/images/recommandation-images/recommendation-preview.png)\n![Personalized home matching](/assets/images/recommandation-images/icon-star.svg)\n\nRecommendations tailored to your real needs.\n\n![Smarter locality suggestions](/assets/images/recommandation-images/pin-icon.svg)\n\nDiscover neighborhoods that fit your lifestyle.\n\n![Budget aware recommendations](/assets/images/recommandation-images/wallet-icon.svg)\n\nFind homes that match your budget.\n\n![Personalized property recommendation cards](/assets/images/recommandation-images/property-img.png)\n![voice search]()![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/2-bhk-flats-for-resale-in-raj-arcade-chs-mahavir-nagar-mumbai-andheri-dahisar-475658-npffid","title":"2 BHK Flats for resale in Raj Arcade CHS, Mahavir Nagar Mumbai - 2 BHK in Raj Arcade CHS for sale","raw_content":"![Logo](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/nnares_logo_white_v2.png)\n![](https://www.99acres.com/universalapp/img/mic.png)\n\n# 2 BHK Resale Flats in Raj Arcade CHS, Mahavir Nagar Mumbai\n\n![](https://www.99acres.com/universalapp/img/city_insights_map.png)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/zrpHeaderImage.png)\n![Verified-Tag](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/GreenVerified.png)\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![PROPERTY-IMAGE](https://imagecdn.99acres.com/media1/40179/1/803581061M-1785137914096.webp)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThis property faces the north direction. The flat occupies a carpet area of 615 sq.Ft. That consists of 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms . The residential building has 7 floors in total and the flat for sale is located on the 4th floor. Being a ready to move project, you can expect immediate possession of this 10+ years old property. The society complex is in the close vicinity of close to metro station...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![NO-IMAGE](https://www.99acres.com/universalapp/img/RequestPhotoTopaz.png)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThe flat is facing the west direction. Constructed on a carpet area of 728 sq.Ft., the flat comprises 2 bedroom(s), 3 bathrooms . This flat is 