tic.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nBhoomi apartment property is located in mahavir nagar, kandivali west\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![](https://www.99acres.com/universalapp/img/voulmeOff.png)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/toapzImage.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nWalkable distance to jain temple, haveli, schoo and other civic amenities\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Fomo-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/star_fomo.svg)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nLocated in the popular residential address of mahavir nagar, western mumbai, atul blue regency is one of the most preferred destination for apartments in western mumbai. This 2 bhk flat is your ticket to be a part of this community. This is a east-Facing property. The floor plan additionally contains 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms . All in all, the flat is spread over a super built up area of 1400 s...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThis property is located in kandivali west\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Fomo-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/star_fomo.svg)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nAvialble 2 bhk in mahavir nagar near hulas basti,570sqft carpet and the price is negotiable note the building is without oc,please contact only genuine buyers\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThis 560 sq.Ft. 2 bhk flat on the 6th floor of a 7-Story mid-Rise building in navjyoti chs, kandivali west, offers immediate availability. The 510-Year-Old residential apartment features 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, unfurnished, close to several temples and essential amenities, making it a practical choice in western mumbai.\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nLavish, luxurious and spacious 2 bhk for sale in the heart of mahavir nagar! \\*near saraswat bank / near vasupujya derasar \\*first owner who bought from builder \\*fully furnished - 720 carpet usable - Super built up is 950 sq ft - 810 sq ft built up in agreement \\*floor - 6 of 7 \\*24 year old bldg \\*open parking \\*lucky south door but can be shifted to east (Many flats in society have done this) \\*rede...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nAvailable immediately, this 2 bhk flat spans 735 sq.Ft. On the 14th floor of a 15-Story high-Rise in govardhan nagar, kandivali west. Featuring 2 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, the 10+ year-Old residence is offered unfurnished. Conveniently close to several temples and a united bank atm, it combines comfort with accessibility in western mumbai.\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nSituated in mahavir nagar, western mumbai, nhp anshul heights is a well planned society that offers a pleasant living experience to its residents. This 2 bhk flat in western mumbai is your opportunity to be a part of this community. This property faces the south-West direction. Containing 2 bedroom(s), 2 bathrooms and 1 balcony, this flat is spread over a super built up area of 1092 sq.Ft. This...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/toapzImage.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\n2 bhk for sale j25 icon heights, mahavir nagar\n\n![Verified-Tag](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/GreenVerified.png)\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![](https://www.99acres.com/universalapp/img/voulmeOff.png)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/toapzImage.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Ma