t in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\n3bhk sale at blue regency tower walk in distance from mahavir nagar metro station, kandivali west. Full residential complex of mahavir nahar extension road, kindly call for more details at the property expertz, kandivali west\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBgPremium.svg \"99acres\")\n\n## 3 BHK Flat in Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nGaurav garden is one of the most popular destination for buying apartments/ flats in mahavir nagar, western mumbai. You too can be a part of this society by purchasing this 3 bhk flat here. Constructed on a built up area of 1170 sq.Ft., the flat comprises 3 bedroom(s), 3 bathrooms . The flat has a total of 8 floors and this property is situated on top floor. This 10+ years old property is avail...\n\n![Shortlist-Button](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/Shortlist.png)\n![Tuple-Images](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/noImageBg.svg \"99acres\")\n![Green-Star](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/StarNew.png)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat in Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Grey-Tick](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/checkLineGray.svg)\n![](https://static.99acres.com/universalapp/img/downArrowNew.png)\n\nThis 2 bhk flat in parinee essence, kandivali west, offers 780 sqft of living space on the 21st floor of a 23-Story high-Rise. Built 1-5 years ago, its available for immediate possession. The fully furnished apartment features 2 bathrooms, power backup, lift access, and nearby amenities including a gym, clubhouse, and excellent connectivity via kandivali railway and dahanukarwadi metro stations.\n\n## 2 BHK Flats Raj Arcade CHS Resale, new Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West\n\n### Nearby Societies with 2 BHK Property\n\n### Societie